>Chen</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Montagna</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Comparative isoschizomer profiling of cytosine methylation: the HELP assay</article-title><source>Genome Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>1046</fpage><lpage>1055</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16809668</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1101/gr.5273806</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B4"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lockwood</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name><name><surname>Chari</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Lam</surname><given-names>WL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recent advances in array comparative genomic hybridization technologies and their applications in human genetics</article-title><source>Eur J Hum Genet</source><year>2006</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>139</fpage><lpage>148</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16288307</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.ejhg.5201531</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rauch</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Pfeifer</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>MIRA-assisted microarray analysis, a new technology for the determination of DNA methylation patterns, identifies frequent methylation of homeodomain-containing genes in lung cancer cells</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>7939</fpage><lpage>7947</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16912168</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1158/0008-5472.CAN-06-1888</pub-id></citation></ref>